{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-11_beg",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-11",
  "title": "Snow Upon the Tundra",
  "storyCode": "6-12",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-11_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3ab51725ee46d82d172d2436a5ee10ce5c737ae1121c7468de85248c745e6760",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_f"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "All of the Reunion teams I could reach have pulled out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's a lot of people."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's incredible... like a river."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nesti",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It'll be a river out there in the wilderness... a river of refugees."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nesti",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There's Ursus and Lugmenites out there. Infected and ordinary folk alike. No matter what they came with, they're leaving empty-handed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nesti",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They thought there was a place that would take them. Now they know there's never anywhere they could've gone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nesti",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This river won't flow forever."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(He sounds so sad.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(He picked that up from Big Daddy.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(No wonder. Anyone would get sentimental at a time like this.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If Big Daddy was here, we would've won the fight and it wouldn't have come to this, huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's the luck of the draw. No use thinking about how things could've been."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......Get ready. I'll go talk it over with the Phantom Crossbowmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't rush me. It's not like I don't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hurry up already. Quit screwing around."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm pretty choked up too!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you sure?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's Yeti Squad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What about Amiya and her people?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They're already on their way. Amiya said to tell you to 'take it easy'."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She knows better than to tell me that. It's me, Blaze. When do I ever take it easy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhodes Island Operator",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Blaze! Where are you going?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "To save lives!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_undergroud_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Crossbowmen! Wait up!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yetis... what are you doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's Sister FrostNova... She's growing weak. She can't keep this up for long."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She exhausted her energy pushing back Lungmen's forces. She may not wake up for a while."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You mean you want us to take her with us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But we aren't going back to Chernobog. Faust didn't want Mephisto to go back..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We're begging you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We want Sister to be together with Patriot, in the end!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We know, they're not exactly getting along right now, but... their bond is stronger than blood."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So please... we beg of you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And what will you do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We'll cover you. If we don't hold them back, the Lungmenites will catch you in no time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Once you're all far enough away from Lungmen that you're no longer a threat to them, they'll give up the chase."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But that means, you guys will..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Live by the sword, die by the sword. We're okay with dying in battle."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The future that Sister FrostNova spoke of is still a ways away. But we don't need to see it for ourselves."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We owe you our lives."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's nothing. You're saving our Sister."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...We will do what you ask of us. I swear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Take these armguards. And put on this protective suit."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Our Sister is far too cold for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...She..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...She's so light..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Arts have emptied her body. Easy now, easy..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't wake her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Look at her... look how softly she sleeps."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Goodbye, Sister..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We'll be waiting for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...All right then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's... move on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's us that's moving on."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Phantom Crossbowman",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_016",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We'll meet again, Yetis."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Not too soon, I hope."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_f"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member D",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member D",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are we going to die?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*Ursine profanity*, what are you crying for?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you a Yeti or not?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member D",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are you not crying?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What am I crying about...?! Did you forget what Sister said?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Petrova",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She said not to cry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right! She said not to cry... More than a decade ago, she said not to cry! So I don't want to see any tears! We don't get to cry... because we haven't won yet!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member D",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Once we win, once we're free..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Once we're free, we'll cry our eyes out, in the wilderness, in the snow, in the stacks of wheat piled high, we'll be bawling!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Petrova",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sister was crying as she said it, you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She was only nine at the time. We were all a little older than her..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Petrova",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Without her, we would have died in that mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Petrova",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did you bring the sauce?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Bring the what...? Wait, I thought we weren't allowed to bring it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Petrova",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're not allowed to drink on the march, but you had it with you, I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member D",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I want a drink too..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're not old enough yet, are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member D",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "B- but I've never tried before. I don't want to die without ever tasting it..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Petrova",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Give him a little."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Petrova..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Fine, take a swig. But not too much, we all need a share."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Na zdorovye, brothers! Warm up!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Petrova",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "To Sister! And Big Daddy!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad All Together",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "To FrostNova! And Patriot!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do you know these Infected?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I do, Officer Ch'en."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But this final battle must be fought."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Do we have a choice?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We may not."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Look behind you. They're not even trying to hide themselves anymore."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...The black raincoats."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So, we have to fight them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is what we must do. If we don't, we'll fall short. And the business of pushing the special forces into the Yetis becomes pretty unconvincing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Unless you could convince them to surrender?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "As long as there's Infected behind them... they won't give up."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Amiya."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I won't force you to fight."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm sorry, Officer Ch'en. But... but we will witness it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The L. G. D. fought bravely, no one can deny that. You fought for Lungmen, against the invaders."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is how we will help you against those special forces."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And for our sake... We must record every battle for the Infected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Every single one."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Amiya."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Officer Ch'en?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "When this battle is over, let's grab a bite together."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "B- but I'm Infected..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't care. The loudmouth and the tall lady? They won't mind either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This battle... it's going to cost a lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "For us, it's a battle."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "For Lungmen, it's a war."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And that's what war is."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But whoever it was who planned all this, they're not here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Say, there's something I have to tell you——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——But not right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yeah. Not right now, Officer Ch'en."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Doctor......"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Don't want to watch?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Mhm."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "But just like in the ruins of Chernobog...",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're right. I decided."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I need to see it... with my own eyes."
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Together.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Together."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_f"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member D",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So we don't call her Big Sister because she's older than us...? Why am I just learning this now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well, it works for you. You were three years old back then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member D",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Pfft!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey, what's with the attitude? Did you get drunk off two sips? When you cried out for food, did I feed you or not?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member D",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That was then, this is... now!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Petrova",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You know, it's funny. I'm suddenly thinking about those Rhodes Islanders."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Petrova",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That one cat, with the hot body, the one who said she wanted to drink with us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Petrova",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's too bad. She looked like she'd be able to hold her liquor. She looked like a real good time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But the little rabbit, she can't be old enough yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What is she? 16? 17?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Petrova",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "More like 14. She just seems older because she talks fancy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "As old as Sister was... back then."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's toast them one more time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So it is said, so shall it be done!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nesti",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So shall it be done!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member D",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Um, uh... so shall it be done!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_043_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_043_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Lungmenites should be more coordinated."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Get out of here. The Yetis can only hold them for a while."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_043_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You don't think what they're doing is incredible?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If we die, then they did it all for nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Phantom Crossbowmen say we can't go back to Chernobog. So we're going to a new place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_043_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You don't care where our new base is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_043_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wherever it is, I'm going with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Heh. You Lungmenites are no different from us."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I was hoping they'd treat you better here. Turns out it's the same as it was in Ursus."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_043_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Infected suffer the same everywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's not what you said when you first got here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Nine",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_043_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "People change."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_f"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yetis? Are those the Yetis?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's the Yetis! R- right...? Definitely!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yetiiiis... Yetiiii! Why are you Yetis like this?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Damn it! Don't die! I won't let you die!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just hold on, I can save you! I'll get you to safety...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why do you Infected want to die here?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The special forces stopped attacking? No, looks like they're pulling back...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Seems... they're giving us the initiative."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Are we showing the power of Lungmen's law enforcement? *Lungmen profanity* They underestimated us!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Never mind."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Listen up, this is the last wave! Don't disappoint the people, or Ch'en Sir."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "L. G. D. Officer",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We'll show Reunion how powerful Lungmen is! The Infected won't dare attack our city again!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_f"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Petrova",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hah..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Petrova",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Phantom Crossbowmen, don't let us down. You have to get our Sister back to the old man."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Petrova",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...She's running out of time. She should spend it with him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We don't have much time left ourselves, eh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Petrova",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ready?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ready. Let's give back our lives."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yeti Squad Member B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's show them what the squad trained by Buldrokkas'tee, Ursus's greatest soldier, and led by it's coldest nightmare, can do!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Petrova",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The last of Sister's Originium Arts..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Petrova",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Frost Originium, ready to loose!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Petrova",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Nesti! We're coming!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yetiiiiiiiiiis!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
